<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:05.417" style="s2">2025. 07<br />HANA &amp; JAEI — MEMORIES</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.042" end="00:00:08.792" style="s2">Day one of the trip! Look at Yoon Jaei&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.625" end="00:00:10.708" style="s2">It&#39;s hot...</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.917" end="00:00:14.167" style="s2">Jaei, hurry up!</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.167" end="00:00:15.167" style="s2">Go on ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.375" end="00:00:17.917" style="s2">So, how does it taste?</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.917" end="00:00:20.167" style="s2">Oh, will you stop filming already?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.500" end="00:00:29.542" style="s2">Ah, this is nice.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.542" end="00:00:31.042" style="s2">It is nice...</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.042" end="00:00:37.667" style="s2">Jaei. Hey, Jaei.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.667" end="00:00:39.083" style="s2">Wake up and try a bite.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.083" end="00:00:41.167" style="s2">What is it? I don&#39;t want any.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.167" end="00:00:43.750" style="s2">Jjapagetti? First thing in the morning?</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.750" end="00:00:47.208" style="s2">It turned out really good. Just try one bite.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.208" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">It&#39;s good, right?</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.000" end="00:00:50.875" style="s2">Okay... it is good.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:52.417" style="s2">Great weather today!</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.417" end="00:00:54.042" style="s2">Keep it down.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.667" end="00:00:57.042" style="s2">What do you want to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.042" end="00:00:57.917" style="s2">Anything.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.625" end="00:01:03.958" style="s2">Hurry up!</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.958" end="00:01:05.917" style="s2">Don&#39;t run. You&#39;ll trip.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.208" end="00:01:08.250" style="s2">Grandma,</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.250" end="00:01:09.500" style="s2">we&#39;re here!</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.875" end="00:01:11.958" style="s2">Oh my, Jaei! You&#39;re here!</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.958" end="00:01:12.917" style="s2">How have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.208" end="00:01:15.000" style="s2">Grandma, is Jaei all you see?</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.000" end="00:01:17.292" style="s2">Come in, come in. You must be hungry, Jaei.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.292" end="00:01:17.958" style="s2">Hmph...</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.958" end="00:01:19.208" style="s2">I&#39;m here too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.208" end="00:01:21.583" style="s2">Why are you always filming everything?</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.000" end="00:01:26.708" style="s2">There you go, Jaei. Eat up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.708" end="00:01:28.792" style="s2">Thank you!</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.667" end="00:01:33.542" style="s2">Grandma, what about me? I&#39;m here too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.542" end="00:01:36.208" style="s2">Stop waving that thing around and eat your food.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.458" end="00:01:39.125" style="s2">Wow, the ocean!</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.917" end="00:01:42.667" style="s2">Hey, Yoon Jaei! Hurry up!</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.667" end="00:01:43.875" style="s2">I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.375" end="00:01:46.333" style="s2">Hurry up already!</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.042" end="00:01:48.583" style="s2">Hey, knock it off.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.750" end="00:01:55.292" style="s2">Why, you...</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.292" end="00:01:57.167" style="s2">Ahh! Hey, Yoon Jaei!</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.333" end="00:02:03.458" style="s2">Ah, this is the life.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.458" end="00:02:05.667" style="s2">How are you always this happy?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.083" end="00:02:13.333" style="s2">Ugh, get a room.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.333" end="00:02:14.625" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.750" end="00:02:17.208" style="s2">How come I&#39;m the only one without a boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.500" end="00:02:18.417" style="s2">Then get one.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.417" end="00:02:19.667" style="s2">I don&#39;t need one.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.375" end="00:02:22.250" style="s2">You don&#39;t need one? More like you can&#39;t get one.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.458" end="00:02:23.708" style="s2">Hey! Yoon Jaei!</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.042" end="00:02:27.125" style="s2">Jaei.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.125" end="00:02:27.583" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.583" end="00:02:29.500" style="s2">Let&#39;s come back here together next year.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.500" end="00:02:30.042" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.042" end="00:02:31.333" style="s2">Promise we&#39;ll come back?</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.333" end="00:02:32.500" style="s2">I said we will.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.500" end="00:02:35.333" style="s2">You&#39;d better keep that promise...</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.708" end="00:02:43.417" style="s2">2026. 07</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.625" end="00:02:50.000" style="s2">She looks like she got dumped.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.458" end="00:02:53.083" style="s2">Yeah... she&#39;s really crying her heart out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.542" end="00:03:01.708" style="s2">Hey, Yoon Jaei...</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.708" end="00:03:03.792" style="s2">You promised me...</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.792" end="00:03:07.000" style="s2">You said we&#39;d come back here together this year...</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.292" end="00:03:18.208" style="s2">Hey...</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.208" end="00:03:20.167" style="s2">why are you crying out here all alone? Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.750" end="00:03:24.708" style="s2">Please leave me alone.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.375" end="00:03:26.417" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.417" end="00:03:27.375" style="s2">Tell me what&#39;s wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.375" end="00:03:30.250" style="s2">I said I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.250" end="00:03:30.958" style="s2">Come on,</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.958" end="00:03:32.458" style="s2">come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.458" end="00:03:33.875" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you feel better.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.167" end="00:03:36.875" style="s2">Hey, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.250" end="00:03:40.250" style="s2">Come on, I&#39;m not a bad guy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.875" end="00:03:43.542" style="s2">I said no! Let go of me!</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.000" end="00:03:46.375" style="s2">What the fuck? Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.500" end="00:03:53.542" style="s2">You bastard! Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.875" end="00:03:55.500" style="s2">Hey, wait! Don&#39;t come any closer!</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.583" end="00:04:08.500" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.583" end="00:04:10.375" style="s2">Yes...</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.375" end="00:04:11.208" style="s2">I&#39;m okay...</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.125" end="00:04:15.167" style="s2">Thank you for helping me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.167" end="00:04:16.333" style="s2">Oh... sure.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.333" end="00:04:17.500" style="s2">I&#39;ll get going, then...</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.583" end="00:04:27.125" style="s2">Yes. It appears she is no longer in contact with Yoon Jaei.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.125" end="00:04:29.042" style="s2">Keep an eye on her anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.042" end="00:04:31.750" style="s2">She may prove useful as leverage against Baek-ya later.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.750" end="00:04:32.833" style="s2">Yes, understood.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.958" end="00:05:03.083" style="s2">Oof, my back. Sure is hot today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.750" end="00:05:08.417" style="s2">Hana, why are you lying around like that?</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.417" end="00:05:11.625" style="s2">If you&#39;re bored, why don&#39;t you go for a swim?</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.208" end="00:05:17.167" style="s2">I went last night...</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.333" end="00:05:20.708" style="s2">Is Jaei that busy?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.708" end="00:05:22.667" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t she come with you this year?</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.167" end="00:05:27.667" style="s2">I don&#39;t know...</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.667" end="00:05:31.750" style="s2">What, did you two have a fight?</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.375" end="00:05:43.125" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong? You&#39;re both grown-ups. Why are you fighting?</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.125" end="00:05:44.625" style="s2">We didn&#39;t fight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.875" end="00:05:46.625" style="s2">Then what is it?</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.625" end="00:05:48.167" style="s2">Is work giving you a hard time?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.917" end="00:05:58.250" style="s2">Grandma...</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.250" end="00:05:59.750" style="s2">Jaei&#39;s gone...</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.417" end="00:06:01.792" style="s2">What do you mean? Where did Jaei go?</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.792" end="00:06:02.958" style="s2">How can she just be gone?</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.333" end="00:06:11.167" style="s2">I don&#39;t know...</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.167" end="00:06:13.375" style="s2">She just disappeared...</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.750" end="00:06:15.833" style="s2">Maybe she went home for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.667" end="00:06:19.167" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t have anywhere else to call home!</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.167" end="00:06:21.875" style="s2">This is her home...</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.875" end="00:06:22.875" style="s2">I&#39;m...</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.875" end="00:06:25.000" style="s2">I&#39;m her family.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.000" end="00:06:27.333" style="s2">Where else could she possibly go?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.792" end="00:06:30.042" style="s2">Oh, don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.042" end="00:06:33.083" style="s2">She&#39;s probably just gone away for a while. She&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.083" end="00:06:36.375" style="s2">You said there were times you couldn&#39;t reach her before.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.583" end="00:06:38.458" style="s2">No...</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.458" end="00:06:41.750" style="s2">I just feel like she&#39;s never coming back...</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.750" end="00:06:47.375" style="s2">Grandma, what am I supposed to do if I never see Jaei again?</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.875" end="00:07:46.125" style="s2">...Ugh...</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.667" end="00:07:52.833" style="s2">How was your vacation, Hana?</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.833" end="00:07:54.542" style="s2">Oh, yes. Good morning...</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.875" end="00:07:56.042" style="s2">Hana,</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.042" end="00:07:57.208" style="s2">you cut your hair.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.458" end="00:07:58.583" style="s2">Oh, yes...</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.375" end="00:08:05.750" style="s2">Morning, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.417" end="00:08:08.083" style="s2">Good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.750" end="00:08:13.750" style="s2">All right, everyone. This is Go Jihoon, our new intern.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.750" end="00:08:14.708" style="s2">Jihoon, say hello.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.917" end="00:08:19.750" style="s2">Hello, I&#39;m Go Jihoon.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.750" end="00:08:20.667" style="s2">I look forward to working with you all!</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.167" end="00:08:23.833" style="s2">Huh...?</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.000" end="00:08:28.417" style="s2">Jihoon, do your best, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.417" end="00:08:29.042" style="s2">Yes, I will!</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.292" end="00:08:47.583" style="s2">Hana, these numbers are off again.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.917" end="00:08:50.417" style="s2">Huh? But I double-checked...</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.042" end="00:08:52.167" style="s2">Oh...</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.708" end="00:08:56.625" style="s2">Hana. I know you&#39;re trying...</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.958" end="00:09:02.083" style="s2">But you&#39;ve been here six months now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.083" end="00:09:04.083" style="s2">You should be able to handle this much on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.375" end="00:09:07.083" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry... I&#39;ll fix it right away.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.292" end="00:09:10.292" style="s2">Check it one more time before you send it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.250" end="00:09:12.958" style="s2">Okay...</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.542" end="00:09:23.083" style="s2">Jihoon, you&#39;re done already?</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.458" end="00:09:24.583" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.583" end="00:09:26.417" style="s2">I organized everything the way you asked.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.417" end="00:09:28.625" style="s2">Are you sure you&#39;re an intern?</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.625" end="00:09:30.917" style="s2">You&#39;ve only been here a few days. How are you this good already?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.917" end="00:09:33.125" style="s2">You&#39;re fast, and you&#39;ve got good instincts.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.125" end="00:09:35.708" style="s2">Looks like we lucked out with our new guy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.333" end="00:09:37.750" style="s2">Not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.750" end="00:09:39.417" style="s2">I still have a lot to learn.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.750" end="00:09:43.958" style="s2">Don&#39;t be so modest. You did great.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.958" end="00:09:45.042" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.042" end="00:10:03.833" style="s2">Jihoon, you finished everything for today, right?</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.833" end="00:10:05.583" style="s2">Yes. It&#39;s all done.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.958" end="00:10:07.625" style="s2">Then go ahead and head home.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.625" end="00:10:08.667" style="s2">Good work today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.625" end="00:10:11.208" style="s2">Well, I&#39;ll get going then.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.875" end="00:10:22.250" style="s2">Hana, you need to fix that before you leave today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.250" end="00:10:23.167" style="s2">Oh, okay...</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.250" end="00:10:29.000" style="s2">The new intern is really good,</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.000" end="00:10:30.458" style="s2">isn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.792" end="00:10:32.292" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.292" end="00:10:34.708" style="s2">He&#39;s sharp and catches on fast.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.208" end="00:10:39.458" style="s2">He&#39;s only been here a few days, but he already seems settled in.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.833" end="00:10:44.417" style="s2">What about Hana? How&#39;s she doing these days?</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.292" end="00:10:48.625" style="s2">She&#39;s diligent, but she&#39;s still a little slow and inexperienced.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.625" end="00:10:51.000" style="s2">She&#39;ll get better.</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.458" end="00:10:53.917" style="s2">But don&#39;t you think Jihoon&#39;s kind of handsome?</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.917" end="00:10:57.333" style="s2">Totally. He&#39;d be seriously hot without the glasses.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.667" end="00:11:11.542" style="s2">I&#39;ll just work harder. No big deal.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.958" end="00:11:42.083" style="s2">You&#39;re missing one here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.083" end="00:11:43.000" style="s2">Just redo this part.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.750" end="00:11:45.167" style="s2">Okay. I&#39;ll redo it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.625" end="00:12:06.375" style="s2">Hana.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.208" end="00:12:07.833" style="s2">Yes?</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.958" end="00:12:10.042" style="s2">This one&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.042" end="00:12:11.333" style="s2">No revisions today.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.750" end="00:12:12.708" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.708" end="00:12:13.167" style="s2">Yep.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.542" end="00:12:14.917" style="s2">You get to leave on time today.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.917" end="00:12:16.417" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.125" end="00:12:17.833" style="s2">Good work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.958" end="00:12:33.000" style="s2">Finally, out on time!</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.000" end="00:12:34.042" style="s2">What should I do tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.792" end="00:12:47.833" style="s2">All right!</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.542" end="00:12:53.667" style="s2">Time to blow off some steam!</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.625" end="00:13:17.042" style="s2">I&#39;ll finish you with one blow!</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.583" end="00:13:20.458" style="s2">You&#39;d have to land it first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.833" end="00:13:55.958" style="s2">Pfft. Big guy,</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.958" end="00:13:57.208" style="s2">no big deal.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.000" end="00:13:58.917" style="s2">All right,</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.917" end="00:14:00.583" style="s2">on to the next stage~</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.417" end="00:14:19.792" style="s2">What? You&#39;re the new challenger?</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.792" end="00:14:21.083" style="s2">You&#39;re so cute~</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.583" end="00:14:23.792" style="s2">Seriously? You really want to fight me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.375" end="00:14:26.458" style="s2">All right!</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.458" end="00:14:27.750" style="s2">I&#39;ll go easy on you!</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.625" end="00:14:39.333" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.875" end="00:14:40.250" style="s2">Wait!</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.083" end="00:14:47.042" style="s2">Huh... you little runt.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.292" end="00:14:53.042" style="s2">So you wanna go, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.250" end="00:15:08.167" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.167" end="00:15:09.333" style="s2">Are you messing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.958" end="00:15:14.875" style="s2">Hey! You&#39;re not cute anymore!</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.833" end="00:15:28.667" style="s2">What the... How are you this strong?</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.208" end="00:16:18.167" style="s2">Damn it!</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.833" end="00:16:21.250" style="s2">I&#39;m done!</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.250" end="00:16:30.333" style="s2">Huh...?</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.917" end="00:16:39.958" style="s2">Ugh, so annoying! Why do I keep running into that guy...?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.042" end="00:16:44.750" style="s2">Ugh...</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.292" end="00:16:47.250" style="s2">All that anger made me hungry...</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.708" end="00:17:01.958" style="s2">Are you ready to order?</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.958" end="00:17:04.292" style="s2">One jumbo pork cutlet, please.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.500" end="00:17:04.875" style="s2">Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.875" end="00:17:06.583" style="s2">It&#39;ll be just a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.458" end="00:17:21.292" style="s2">Welcome!</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.292" end="00:17:21.958" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.958" end="00:17:24.458" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, we&#39;re full right now...</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.458" end="00:17:26.042" style="s2">Oh, just a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.458" end="00:17:28.167" style="s2">Um... excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.167" end="00:17:29.792" style="s2">we&#39;re out of tables.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.792" end="00:17:31.750" style="s2">Would you mind sharing your table?</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.167" end="00:17:36.458" style="s2">Uh... sure.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.792" end="00:17:38.417" style="s2">Would you like to sit over here?</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.417" end="00:17:39.458" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.750" end="00:17:47.375" style="s2">...Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.375" end="00:17:48.292" style="s2">And for you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.625" end="00:17:49.792" style="s2">One jumbo pork cutlet, please.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.917" end="00:17:51.458" style="s2">Sure! It&#39;ll be just a moment~</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.750" end="00:17:54.667" style="s2">We meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.208" end="00:18:05.292" style="s2">Do you play games a lot?</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.208" end="00:18:06.792" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.542" end="00:18:08.833" style="s2">You were really bad at it, though...</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.250" end="00:18:11.875" style="s2">Are you always this obnoxious?</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.875" end="00:18:13.542" style="s2">What...? Me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.375" end="00:18:15.167" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.167" end="00:18:16.542" style="s2">Who else would I be talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.000" end="00:18:26.000" style="s2">Hana,</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.000" end="00:18:27.208" style="s2">where are you going after this?</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.292" end="00:18:30.250" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.250" end="00:18:32.333" style="s2">Planning to follow me again?</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.083" end="00:18:34.833" style="s2">No, I was just curious...</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.500" end="00:18:46.750" style="s2">Take care, Hana.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.667" end="00:19:14.958" style="s2">This isn&#39;t fun at all...</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.042" end="00:19:19.208" style="s2">Jaei...</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.208" end="00:19:20.458" style="s2">I miss you...</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.292" end="00:19:38.000" style="s2">Oh?</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.000" end="00:19:38.875" style="s2">We meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.583" end="00:19:45.042" style="s2">Are you following me or something?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.375" end="00:19:46.417" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.625" end="00:19:49.083" style="s2">But... I was here first.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.375" end="00:19:52.875" style="s2">Would you like to sit here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.625" end="00:19:55.417" style="s2">This is my spot, you know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.292" end="00:20:13.458" style="s2">What are you thinking about?</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.875" end="00:20:15.667" style="s2">I&#39;m not thinking about anything.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.167" end="00:20:18.958" style="s2">You don&#39;t look like it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.667" end="00:20:22.167" style="s2">Why are you staring at my face like that?</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.500" end="00:20:24.042" style="s2">I was just asking.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.458" end="00:20:27.042" style="s2">Could you just leave me alone?</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.875" end="00:20:28.500" style="s2">Okay...</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.500" end="00:20:29.875" style="s2">I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.125" end="00:20:36.958" style="s2">Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.417" end="00:20:42.750" style="s2">Sorry about before.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.750" end="00:20:44.792" style="s2">I actually really love this stuff too.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.875" end="00:20:49.167" style="s2">No, thanks...</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.167" end="00:20:52.083" style="s2">Come on~ Don&#39;t be like that. Just take it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.750" end="00:21:04.125" style="s2">Hana,</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.125" end="00:21:05.958" style="s2">do you want to be friends with me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.958" end="00:21:07.125" style="s2">Why would I?</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.333" end="00:21:10.750" style="s2">Why not? I&#39;m fun to hang out with~</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.750" end="00:21:12.875" style="s2">Yeah, I&#39;ll pass.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.000" end="00:21:31.583" style="s2">Yeah. Did you look into what I asked?</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.583" end="00:21:35.042" style="s2">Well...</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.042" end="00:21:39.292" style="s2">we couldn&#39;t find anything unusual about a man named Go Jihoon.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.167" end="00:21:42.625" style="s2">Nothing connecting him to Baek-ya either?</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.000" end="00:21:46.500" style="s2">No, sir. Nothing notable in the records.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.500" end="00:21:51.333" style="s2">He recently joined Seol Hana&#39;s company as an intern. That&#39;s all we found.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.833" end="00:21:54.500" style="s2">All right. I&#39;ll call you back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.667" end="00:21:58.667" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.958" end="00:22:03.000" style="s2">Do you make a habit of getting into other people&#39;s cars?</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.458" end="00:22:07.583" style="s2">Better than making a habit of following people around.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.833" end="00:22:10.125" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.125" end="00:22:18.542" style="s2">I was wondering why a busy government agent keeps tailing an ordinary guy like me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.875" end="00:22:21.750" style="s2">So you do know who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.375" end="00:22:27.000" style="s2">You still don&#39;t know who I am, though.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.917" end="00:22:29.833" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.833" end="00:22:31.125" style="s2">Are you with Baek-ya?</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.125" end="00:22:31.917" style="s2">Who knows?</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.542" end="00:22:33.875" style="s2">Take a guess.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.875" end="00:22:36.500" style="s2">Enough games.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.500" end="00:22:38.708" style="s2">Why did you approach Seol Hana?</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.583" end="00:22:45.583" style="s2">Leave Hana alone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.500" end="00:22:53.667" style="s2">You don&#39;t seem to be with Baek-ya. So are you protecting her or watching her?</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.042" end="00:22:59.875" style="s2">If you want to know, figure it out yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.917" end="00:23:07.583" style="s2">I gave you fair warning.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.958" end="00:23:36.625" style="s2">ONE MONTH EARLIER</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.417" end="00:24:40.250" style="s2">Ow, damn it! That hurts!</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.458" end="00:24:44.292" style="s2">Quit whining and get up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.417" end="00:24:51.083" style="s2">Hey, you show up after six years and this is your idea of hello? J?</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.083" end="00:24:52.542" style="s2">You attacked me first.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.750" end="00:24:56.208" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.208" end="00:24:58.792" style="s2">That was a limited-edition figure!</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.083" end="00:25:05.167" style="s2">Sit down before I hit you again.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.500" end="00:25:15.458" style="s2">Watch over Hana while I&#39;m gone.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.458" end="00:25:16.917" style="s2">Six months. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.583" end="00:25:19.208" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.208" end="00:25:22.417" style="s2">You want me to spend six months following that woman around?</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.417" end="00:25:24.875" style="s2">It&#39;s not like you have anything better to do.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.875" end="00:25:26.333" style="s2">Just six months.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.333" end="00:25:28.833" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you run off to another country again?</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.833" end="00:25:30.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.042" end="00:25:32.375" style="s2">And I am busy, you know.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.625" end="00:25:36.667" style="s2">You call that busy?</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.167" end="00:25:42.625" style="s2">If I run now, Hana will be the first one in danger.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.625" end="00:25:45.667" style="s2">Come on. You really think Cha Yura would go that far?</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.125" end="00:25:50.042" style="s2">Have you forgotten what Cha Yura is like?</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.042" end="00:25:52.292" style="s2">She&#39;ll do anything to get what she wants.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.000" end="00:25:54.417" style="s2">Fair enough...</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.417" end="00:25:56.583" style="s2">But what does she mean to you? Why go back there for her?</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.583" end="00:25:59.083" style="s2">Why not just leave her behind?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.375" end="00:26:02.667" style="s2">Okay, okay. You&#39;re too scary to argue with.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.500" end="00:26:09.958" style="s2">But Seol Hana...</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.958" end="00:26:12.167" style="s2">does she really mean that much to you?</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.833" end="00:26:14.542" style="s2">Are you helping me or not?</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.917" end="00:26:17.583" style="s2">Oh. Are you two in love or something?</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.167" end="00:26:19.417" style="s2">It&#39;s not like that.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.417" end="00:26:22.542" style="s2">Then what is it?</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.917" end="00:26:27.125" style="s2">More than that.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.500" end="00:26:32.875" style="s2">Never thought one person would make you come looking for me...</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.875" end="00:26:34.875" style="s2">You&#39;ve changed a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.667" end="00:26:45.333" style="s2">I thought helping you six years ago settled my debt...</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.875" end="00:26:52.667" style="s2">Just this once. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.375" end="00:27:01.833" style="s2">Fine. Six months. Not a day more.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.292" end="00:27:04.000" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.667" end="00:27:09.833" style="s2">And after this, we&#39;re even?</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.833" end="00:27:13.958" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.083" end="00:27:19.458" style="s2">But what if you&#39;re still not back in six months?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.917" end="00:27:25.625" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.375" end="00:27:37.917" style="s2">SIX MONTHS LATER</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.208" end="00:27:44.417" style="s2">Whoa, it&#39;s snowing!</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.000" end="00:27:47.833" style="s2">Hana, what should we do today?</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.500" end="00:27:50.250" style="s2">Arcade first.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.500" end="00:27:51.333" style="s2">Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.333" end="00:27:52.458" style="s2">another rematch?</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.250" end="00:27:56.792" style="s2">I&#39;m taking you down today.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.542" end="00:28:00.625" style="s2">You lose every time. Where do you get that confidence?</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.625" end="00:28:02.833" style="s2">Ugh, do you have to be so annoying?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.833" end="00:28:04.667" style="s2">Okay, okay.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.667" end="00:28:06.833" style="s2">But can we eat something other than pork cutlet today?</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.208" end="00:28:08.958" style="s2">Then eat by yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.958" end="00:28:10.375" style="s2">Oh, fine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.917" end="00:28:44.167" style="s2">Sis, I think that was the last one!</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.875" end="00:28:48.875" style="s2">We&#39;re heading back.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.542" end="00:28:55.875" style="s2">Sis, wait for me!</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.167" end="00:29:20.167" style="s2">MOISTEN.FILM Original Series</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.167" end="00:29:23.250" style="s2">This video was created using AI.<br />All characters, events, settings, and groups depicted are entirely fictional.</p>
